>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `CS_DEEPEN_TAC`

``` hol4
classicalLib.CS_DEEPEN_TAC : clasetLib.claset ->
                          {start : int} -> NTactical.ntactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs an iteratively deepened, claset-explicit tactic.

`CS_DEEPEN_TAC cs {start = n}` safely saturates states and performs bounded
depth-first solve-completely searches starting at `n`. Bounds increase by
2 up to the fixed ceiling 10. Matching safe and zero-premise instantiating
steps are free; positive-premise instantiating and duplicating unsafe steps
consume one unit per branch.

Unlike `DEEPEN_TAC`, this interface permits another starting bound, takes
`cs` directly, exposes its result sequence, and processes no markers.

### Failure

Produces no result if no attempted bound yields a complete proof. Replay
failure is reported as an error.

### Example

``` hol4
val deep =
  classicalLib.CS_DEEPEN_TAC (clasetLib.the_claset ()) {start = 2};
```

